      "description": "Only Farmers connects you with real working farms — the people, the land, and everything they open up to visitors.\n\nDISCOVER FARMS NEAR YOU\nExplore working farms on the map, follow the ones you love and find places you never knew were on your doorstep.\n\nBOOK FARM EXPERIENCES\nFrom farm walks, tastings and workshops to countryside stays, seasonal events and private hire — book memorable days out on working farms. Secure checkout (now with Apple Pay), easy messaging with your hosts, and all your trips in one place.\n\nJOIN THE FARMING COMMUNITY\nOnly Farmers is also the digital home of the farming community: verified farmers sharing knowledge, advice and daily life from the field. Follow farms, join Herds around the topics you care about and see farming as it really happens.\n\nFOR FARMERS\nCreate listings in minutes, manage bookings and payouts, rent out idle equipment, list livestock, post jobs and reach both visitors and fellow farmers.\n\nBuilt for the people who grow, make and share food — and for everyone who wants to feel closer to where it comes from.",
